{"id":"e9217897da5ded39","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-enough-injectives.md","title":"Theorem — 足够多内射对象与内射对象的收缩刻画","display":"Theorem — 足够多内射对象与内射对象的收缩刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-enough-injectives","aliases":["14-thm-enough-injectives"],"display":"Theorem — 足够多内射对象与内射对象的收缩刻画","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-injective-object]]","[[14-thm-exponential-injective]]","[[14-thm-singleton-monomorphism]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]"],"source_location":"IV.10 Corollary3, printed 211; DjVu111; retract characterization derived here","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-enough-injectives"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-enough-injectives</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 足够多内射对象与内射对象的收缩刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d1900a6f3b1135c9\" href=\"?note=d1900a6f3b1135c9\" title=\"14-df-injective-object\">14-df-injective-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2459b62252fa306\" href=\"?note=c2459b62252fa306\" title=\"14-thm-exponential-injective\">14-thm-exponential-injective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e97a040ad360ecb\" href=\"?note=1e97a040ad360ecb\" title=\"14-thm-singleton-monomorphism\">14-thm-singleton-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IV.10 Corollary3, printed 211; DjVu111; retract characterization derived here"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pow}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_A\">\\(\\sigma_A\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c2459b62252fa306\" href=\"?note=c2459b62252fa306\" title=\"14-thm-exponential-injective\">14-thm-exponential-injective</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1e97a040ad360ecb\" href=\"?note=1e97a040ad360ecb\" title=\"14-thm-singleton-monomorphism\">14-thm-singleton-monomorphism</a> 的同一幂对象和单点映射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsInjective}\">\\(\\operatorname{IsInjective}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EnoughInj}\">\\(\\operatorname{EnoughInj}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d1900a6f3b1135c9\" href=\"?note=d1900a6f3b1135c9\" title=\"14-df-injective-object\">14-df-injective-object</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,K\">\\(A,K\\)</span> 为对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:A\\to K\">\\(i:A\\to K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:K\\to A\">\\(r:K\\to A\\)</span> 为候选收缩数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A\">\\(1_A\\)</span> 为恒等箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsMono}(\\sigma_A)\\land\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(\\operatorname{Pow}_{\\mathcal E}(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsMono}(\\sigma_A)\\land\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(\\operatorname{Pow}_{\\mathcal E}(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EnoughInj}(\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EnoughInj}(\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(K)\\land r\\circ i=1_A\\right)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(K)\\land r\\circ i=1_A\\right)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\operatorname{Pow}_{\\mathcal E}(A),A)\\ (r\\circ\\sigma_A=1_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\operatorname{Pow}_{\\mathcal E}(A),A)\\ (r\\circ\\sigma_A=1_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c2459b62252fa306\" href=\"?note=c2459b62252fa306\" title=\"14-thm-exponential-injective\">14-thm-exponential-injective</a>与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1e97a040ad360ecb\" href=\"?note=1e97a040ad360ecb\" title=\"14-thm-singleton-monomorphism\">14-thm-singleton-monomorphism</a>为每个A给出明确的单态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\hookrightarrow\\operatorname{Pow}(A)\">\\(A\\hookrightarrow\\operatorname{Pow}(A)\\)</span>，其靶内射，从而得到原书“足够多”的结论。</p>\n<p>内射对象的收缩仍内射：给单态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:S\\hookrightarrow B\">\\(m:S\\hookrightarrow B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:S\\to A\">\\(f:S\\to A\\)</span>，先沿m延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"if\">\\(if\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:B\\to K\">\\(g:B\\to K\\)</span>，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rg\">\\(rg\\)</span>，便有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rgm=rif=f\">\\(rgm=rif=f\\)</span>。若A内射，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_A\">\\(\\sigma_A\\)</span> 延拓恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A\">\\(1_A\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\operatorname{Pow}(A)\\to A\">\\(r:\\operatorname{Pow}(A)\\to A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\sigma_A=1_A\">\\(r\\sigma_A=1_A\\)</span>。反向由幂对象内射及收缩引理得到。后一刻画为从原书嵌入构造在笔记内推出的补充，不冒称原书另有同名编号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-injective-object","status":"resolved","id":"d1900a6f3b1135c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-injective-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-exponential-injective","status":"resolved","id":"c2459b62252fa306","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","e